Release notes                                                                   
                                                                                
Highlights                                                                      
                                                                                
A paragraph with emphasis, strong text, inline_code and a link to the docs that 
is long enough to wrap onto more lines.                                         
                                                                                
• First bullet                                                                  
  • Nested bullet one                                                           
  • Nested bullet two with enough words to wrap around                          
• Second bullet                                                                 
                                                                                
1. Ordered one                                                                  
2. Ordered two                                                                  
                                                                                
│ A quoted remark that is long enough to wrap when the terminal is narrow.      
                                                                                
